+    /// non-increasing in `k`.  The smallest `k ∈ {1,2,4,8}` within 5 % of
+    /// the cost at the register cap is chosen; the cap keeps
+    /// `k × accs ≤ 8` so eight of the sixteen SIMD registers stay free for
